  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Novgorod stad planerar att starta Municipal Services Improvement Programme (MSIP). Sida &#xE4;mnar finansiera st&#xF6;d till projektf&#xF6;rberedelse med syfte att: (i) utarbeta ToR och (ii) st&#xF6;dja Novgorod stad i upphandlingen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The City of Novgorod is planning to launch a Municipal Services Improvement Programme (MSIP).Sida intends to finance preparation support to Novgorod, with the objectives of (i) elaborating ToR, and (ii) support the Novgorod City Administration during the procurement process.</narrative>
